    "detailed_description": "How should you escape safely when you have an accident on the way? You need to find what you need in the game and get out of here.<br>This is a hardcore survival and escape game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main gameplay of the game</h2>The gameplay of this game is mainly to find items and then escape.<br>There will also be various monsters in the game to stop you from looking for these items.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>Players need to survive and escape in places where food and various materials are limited.<br>And you need to always pay attention to the dangers on the map.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open backpack system</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918590/extras/5cf2275a90a2ad9b1e85ff30e03d5600.avif?t=1724310771\" width=600 height=360 /></span><br>Players are free to carry items and match equipment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic medical system</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918590/extras/854d75618acb635cd399d11022331381.avif?t=1724310771\" width=600 height=360 /></span><br><br>If you are injured, you can't recover your blood quickly. You need to use items such as medical kits to recover.<br>There is also a bleeding system in the game. Once the player doesn't stop bleeding, he will die of blood loss.<br>There are also painkillers in the game, which can reduce the pain and ambiguity caused by the attack.<br>We will make him more realistic in the future, which is one of our main goals.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mobile phone system</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918590/extras/9b89b0ef809a46a2cbf5cdf02da832cd.avif?t=1724310771\" width=390 height=664 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918590/extras/bd445d43cdca9f87732012afaad85a77.avif?t=1724310771\" width=380 height=654 /></span><br>There are many practical softwares (chat and navigation) in the mobile phone in the game, which can make it easier for players to better pass the game.<br>And more functions will be added in the future.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A variety of monsters</h2>Every map has its own different monsters.<br>Each monster has its own special effects, and players need to understand these monsters and react.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The story of the map</h2>You can choose to leave immediately after finding what you need, or explore what happened in this area.<br><br>The game supports 1~4 players to cooperate.",
